## Getting started

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate        # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
```

## Run the multimodal pipeline

```bash
# Run with bundled sample image
python -m app.main

# Or pass your own image file and prompt
python -m app.main path/to/image.png "What objects are in this photo?"
```

## Run tests

```bash
pytest
```
